mattbusel-llm-cpp is header-only and provides CMake targets:

  find_package(llm-cpp CONFIG REQUIRED)
  target_link_libraries(main PRIVATE llm::llm)

Or pick libraries, e.g. llm::cache, llm::json, llm::stream:

  find_package(llm-cpp CONFIG REQUIRED COMPONENTS cache json stream)
  target_link_libraries(main PRIVATE llm::cache llm::json llm::stream)

The network libraries (ab, agent, audio, batch, chat, compress_summarize,
embed, eval, finetune, rag, rank, stream, vision) need libcurl:
install mattbusel-llm-cpp[curl].
